<title>UK: Hypo Hannover sets 100 mln mark step-up bond, call.</title>
<headline>Hypo Hannover sets 100 mln mark step-up bond, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up callable domestic bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG HANNOVER</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0 PCT   MATURITY  **16.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HANNOVER  DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 16.OCT.97 WHEN THE DEAL IS CALLABLE, STEPPING-UP</p>
<p>		ANNUALLY THEREAFTER TO 4.5 PCT, 5.5 PCT, 6.0 PCT</p>
<p>		AND 7.0 PCT.</p>
<p>		**CALL ON 16.OCT.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
